      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.5319119848386206,
        "x1": 0.6835620855194291,
        "y1": 0.5458008737275095
      },
      "text": "by ten thousand tons of T.N.T. [",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6831383798636642,
        "y0": 0.5319119848386206,
        "x1": 0.6920084735147314,
        "y1": 0.5458008737275095
      },
      "text": "sic",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6919382132735907,
        "y0": 0.5319119848386206,
        "x1": 0.7461473552230137,
        "y1": 0.5458008737275095
      },
      "text": "]” The actual",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.530396702313664,
        "x1": 0.9706268310546875,
        "y1": 0.5442855912025528
      },
      "text": "blanket facing south” and looked through a welder’s",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.5485786669182056,
        "x1": 0.6420334959341809,
        "y1": 0.5624675558070944
      },
      "text": "yield was about 21 kt.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.5470632687963621,
        "x1": 0.9694496104919833,
        "y1": 0.560952157685251
      },
      "text": "glass with his left eye. The flash temporarily blinded",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.5637300664728337,
        "x1": 0.9678139281428717,
        "y1": 0.5776189553617227
      },
      "text": "his open, unprotected right eye but through his left",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.58039682561701,
        "x1": 0.7403954399956597,
        "y1": 0.5942857145058988
      },
      "text": "Victor Weisskopf, also at base camp “on a little",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.5803965944232363,
        "x1": 0.9583956649880004,
        "y1": 0.5942854833121252
      },
      "text": "he saw the “amazingly bright” light that “turned",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.5970635076965949,
        "x1": 0.6433815550959967,
        "y1": 0.6109523965854837
      },
      "text": "ridge about 100 yds. [",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6429581486321743,
        "y0": 0.5970635076965949,
        "x1": 0.6518282422832414,
        "y1": 0.6109523965854837
      },
      "text": "sic",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6517579820421007,
        "y0": 0.5970635076965949,
        "x1": 0.7531934251972273,
        "y1": 0.6109523965854837
      },
      "text": "] east of the water tower,”",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.5970632765028212,
        "x1": 0.9407364589716095,
        "y1": 0.61095216539171
      },
      "text": "yellow, then red, and then beautiful purple,”",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.6137301897761798,
        "x1": 0.7520964379404106,
        "y1": 0.6276190786650686
      },
      "text": "watched indirectly “through the dark glass” so he",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.6137300356469972,
        "x1": 0.9454634922002655,
        "y1": 0.6276189245358862
      },
      "text": "eventually rising “in something of a toadstool",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.6303968333234691,
        "x1": 0.7546037661483864,
        "y1": 0.6442857222123579
      },
      "text": "could see the deflected light. “When the explosion",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.6303966021296954,
        "x1": 0.9626735113804636,
        "y1": 0.6442854910185842
      },
      "text": "effect.” After the cloud turned to a “ponderously”",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.647063515403054,
        "x1": 0.7421208799274919,
        "y1": 0.6609524042919428
      },
      "text": "went off,” he wrote, “I was first dazzled by this",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.6470633998061671,
        "x1": 0.9552771873723448,
        "y1": 0.6609522886950561
      },
      "text": "moving cylinder of white smoke and a “hole was",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.663730178216491,
        "x1": 0.7369265088848039,
        "y1": 0.6776190671053799
      },
      "text": "indirect light which was much stronger than I",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.6637299277565696,
        "x1": 0.9602379892386642,
        "y1": 0.6776188166454584
      },
      "text": "punched well above the white smoke column,” he",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.6803968410299281,
        "x1": 0.756976358251634,
        "y1": 0.6942857299188171
      },
      "text": "anticipated, and I was not able to concentrate upon",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.6803965905700067,
        "x1": 0.9646955502578636,
        "y1": 0.6942854794588955
      },
      "text": "saw “two fog rings . . . well above the white smoke",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.6970635038433652,
        "x1": 0.7562034457337623,
        "y1": 0.7109523927322542
      },
      "text": "the view through the dark glass.” Looking directly",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.6970633882464785,
        "x1": 0.9652796726600796,
        "y1": 0.7109522771353673
      },
      "text": "column.” Then, he said, “There was a spontaneous",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.7137301859229501,
        "x1": 0.7514403598760467,
        "y1": 0.7276190748118391
      },
      "text": "at the explosion 3 seconds later, he saw “a reddish",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.7137299161968809,
        "x1": 0.9680386212916156,
        "y1": 0.7276188050857698
      },
      "text": "cheer of the observers.” Although he did not report",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.7303968487363873,
        "x1": 0.7575065263735703,
        "y1": 0.7442857376252763
      },
      "text": "glowing smoke ball rising with a thick stem of dark",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.7303967138733527,
        "x1": 0.9566702250561683,
        "y1": 0.7442856027622415
      },
      "text": "heat, Smith noted that roughly 1.5 minutes after",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.7470635115498244,
        "x1": 0.7511977152107587,
        "y1": 0.7609524004387134
      },
      "text": "brown color . . . surrounded by a blue glow.” The",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.747063261089903,
        "x1": 0.9472609376595691,
        "y1": 0.7609521499787918
      },
      "text": "the light “a sharp loud crack swept over us—it",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.7637301743632615,
        "x1": 0.7547835306404462,
        "y1": 0.7776190632521505
      },
      "text": "shock wave through the clouds was “plainly visible",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.76372992390334,
        "x1": 0.971938987183415,
        "y1": 0.777618812792229
      },
      "text": "reverberated through the mountain[s] like thunder.”",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.7803968371766986,
        "x1": 0.7543971242468341,
        "y1": 0.7942857260655876
      },
      "text": "as an expanding circle all over the sky where it was",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.7803967215798118,
        "x1": 0.9697102066738154,
        "y1": 0.7942856104687007
      },
      "text": "He estimated the fireball was “1 to 2 miles wide.” A",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.7970635192562836,
        "x1": 0.7468660142686632,
        "y1": 0.8109524081451724
      },
      "text": "covered by clouds.” Weisskopf “felt very strongly",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.7970633843932489,
        "x1": 0.9678230036317913,
        "y1": 0.8109522732821378
      },
      "text": "nearby observer guessed the strength to be “at least",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.8137301820697207,
        "x1": 0.7389845505259396,
        "y1": 0.8276190709586095
      },
      "text": "the heat radiation all over the exposed parts of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679446849947661,
        "y0": 0.8137299316097992,
        "x1": 0.9122208738638684,
        "y1": 0.8276188204986881
      },
      "text": "5000 tons and probably a lot more.”",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.9138677260454964,
        "y0": 0.8159987420746775,
        "x1": 0.922024595971201,
        "y1": 0.826503792194405
      },
      "text": "7",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.8303968448831578,
        "x1": 0.7427589566099877,
        "y1": 0.8442857337720466
      },
      "text": "my body.” The sound wave arrived “after about",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679447847254136,
        "y0": 0.8455481095747515,
        "x1": 0.9694856132557189,
        "y1": 0.8594369984636403
      },
      "text": "For these and the accounts of other observers in the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.8470635076965949,
        "x1": 0.7540285696391187,
        "y1": 0.8609523965854837
      },
      "text": "45 seconds and it struck me as being much weaker",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.8637301801431059,
        "x1": 0.6655972050685509,
        "y1": 0.8776190690319947
      },
      "text": "than anticipated,” he wrote.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679447847254136,
        "y0": 0.8622147723881886,
        "x1": 0.9717324450125102,
        "y1": 0.8761036612770774
      },
      "text": "Trinity test area, see the Laboratory’s history page at",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679447847254136,
        "y0": 0.8788815700646603,
        "x1": 0.9518263075086806,
        "y1": 0.8927704589535491
      },
      "text": "http://www.lanl.gov/history/atomicbomb/trinity.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.8955483581080581,
        "x1": 0.7586119907354217,
        "y1": 0.9094372469969471
      },
      "text": "About 20 miles from the detonation point, Captain",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7679447847254136,
        "y0": 0.8955482328780974,
        "x1": 0.7879946340922437,
        "y1": 0.9094371217669863
      },
      "text": "shtml",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7880725735932393,
        "y0": 0.8955482328780974,
        "x1": 0.790588927424811,
        "y1": 0.9094371217669863
      },
      "text": ".",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.9122150257380321,
        "x1": 0.7616495369306577,
        "y1": 0.9261039146269211
      },
      "text": "R. A. Larkin, seated on the ground, deliberately had",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5588235294117647,
        "y0": 0.9288816933680062,
        "x1": 0.7545408859751583,
        "y1": 0.9427705822568951
      },
      "text": "his “eyes fixed on the ground immediately in front",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
